 mobile component remained a draft, lacking filter controls. Initial desktop reports used an incorrect denominator of automated accounts.\n\n**Recalculating mobile adoption numbers**\n\nCorrected desktop usage post-rollback, excluding bot accounts, showed 21% adoption. There has been no mobile status filter progress.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"view_file","args":{"AbsolutePath":"\"/workspace/skill/assets/action.md\"","toolAction":"\"View action asset template\"","toolSummary":"\"View action.md asset\""}}],"truncated_fields":["thinking"]}
